l=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/94-4.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Ash-Sharh 94:4 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Kuma Muka ɗaukaka maka ambatonka?\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/94.html\">Sura Ash-Sharh</a> › Aya 4</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Ash-Sharh 94:4</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَرَفَعْنَا لَكَ ذِكْرَكَ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Kuma Muka ɗaukaka maka ambatonka?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهذا كالتشهد والخطب والأذان أشهد أن لا إله إلا الله وأشهد أن محمدا رسول الله فلا يصح الإسلام إلا بذكره والشهادة له بالرسالة.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 19/104</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s94a4\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/94-1.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (94:1)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/94-7.html\">Aya ta gaba (94:7)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/94-7.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Ash-Sharh 94:7 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sabõda haka idan ka ƙãre (ibãda) sai ka kafu (kana rõƙon Allah).\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/94-7.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Ash-Sharh 94:7 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sabõda haka idan ka ƙãre (ibãda) sai ka kafu (kana rõƙon Allah).\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/94.html\">Sura Ash-Sharh</a> › Aya 7</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Ash-Sharh 94:7</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَإِذَا فَرَغْتَ فَانصَبْ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sabõda haka idan ka ƙãre (ibãda) sai ka kafu (kana rõƙon Allah).</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Shaikhul Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">مع أن تفسير قوله: {فإذا فرغت فانصب} أي فرغت من الصلاة قول ضعيف فإن قوله: إذا فرغت مطلق ولأن الفارغ إن أريد به الفارغ من العبادة فالدعاء أيضا عبادة<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/496</cite></blockquote><h3>Abin da ya ruwaito daga wasu</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">أشهر قولي المفسرين</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «قيل: إذا فرغت من أشغال الدنيا فانصب في العبادة وإلى ربك فارغب. وهذا أشهر القولين.»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/495</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">بعض المفسرين</span> <span class=\"st\">ردّه</span> «أي فرغت من الصلاة»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/496</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">قيل</span> <span class=\"st\">ردّه</span> «{فإذا فرغت} من الصلاة {فانصب} في الدعاء {وإلى ربك فارغب} .»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/495</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s94a7\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/94-4.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (94:4)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/94-8.html\">Aya ta gaba (94:8)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/94-8.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Ash-Sharh 94:8 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Kuma zuwa ga Ubangijinka ka yi kwaɗayi.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/94-8.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hr